      "content": "it cut off at the end there lol, can u finish that last part? and also, we're gonna get some heat from the activists about the 'stricter sentencing' bit—they always talk about how it's too harsh or causes more problems. can u add a section to the speech that shuts that down? maybe explain why their perspective is just wrong and why our way is the only way to actually fix it.",
